<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Module 30 contains all recreational and recreational areas that are located outside the building site, such as golf courses, baths, sports fields, stadiums, campsites, parks, animal parks or cemeteries. \nSki slopes are not included here, as they are also largely used for agricultural purposes. As in all other classes, all agricultural land, forest land and water are excluded from land use. An example is the Viennese Prater, which"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leisure and Recreation (Module 30)"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Schiene"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "no evaluation category, only survey category: DKM mining areas, dumps or landfills"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/104> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Industrial and commercial areas comprise all settlement areas within building land zoning that are not used for agriculture or located within the transport module, and which are designated in the aggregated zoning categories as a class with 'predominantly commercial and industrial use'. This includes industrial, commercial, and business zoning designations, as well as shopping centres, retail parks, or retail facilities."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
