<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The evaluation category '105 – Airport' includes all airports in Austria that have an airport boundary in the BEV Digital Landscape Model. This includes all buildings and structures, as well as runways, access roads, and taxiways. Furthermore, it encompasses all intermediate areas serving airport operations (including all grassy areas between taxiways, provided they are not used for agricultural purposes)."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
