<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Agricultural areas that are not registered in the IACS, but are identified as active agricultural areas on the basis of remote sensing evaluations and are within the aggregated ÖROK dedication category 5 'Leisure and recreation'"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
