<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Supply and disposal and mining areas consist of operating areas of supply and disposal infrastructure, such as sewage treatment plants, substations, power plants, power poles, as well as landfills and mining areas, insofar as they are not included in the settlement areas.\nAs in all other classes, all agricultural land, forest land and water are excluded from land use."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
