<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Flächeninanspruchnahme"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "no evaluation category, only survey category: mining areas that can only be identified by the aggregated ÖROK area dedication category 6 'Supply and disposal'."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
