<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/600> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/2112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "'Residential use' encompasses all areas designated in zoning plans either predominantly for residential use or for mixed use (residential and commercial). It includes traditional single-family housing developments as well as multi-storey residential housing or inner-city mixed residential and commercial quarters, including green courtyards and garden areas, provided they are not designated as dedicated sports, leisure, or recreational areas."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/422> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
