<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme/302> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "no evaluation category, only survey category: supply and disposal areas according to the DLM of the Bev (category 3200 leisure time)"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/oerok-flaecheninanspruchnahme:1> .
